			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"旭东"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 721680201,
					"content": "芭尔瓦涅，真的没有别的方法了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "旭东"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680202,
					"content": "我手上的这本书里就只记载了那一种方法。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭尔瓦涅"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680203,
					"content": "呜…如果只是有魔物拦路的话…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朱莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680204,
					"content": "这是你们要的「绯樱绣球」吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680205
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721680205,
					"content": "喔！没错，这就是我们要的那种「绯樱绣球」，这种色泽…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "旭东"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680206,
					"content": "太好啦！终于可以做好吃的啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朱莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680207,
					"content": "等一下，你已经进去那个屏障里面了？用的是我们告诉你的那种方法吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭尔瓦涅"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680208,
					"content": "是的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680209
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721680209,
					"content": "能告诉我你找到的那个「雷樱枝条」在哪吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭尔瓦涅"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680210,
					"content": "你触摸了「雷樱枝条」之后，那个「雷种子」是怎么附着在你身上的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭尔瓦涅"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680211,
					"content": "抱歉，我先把笔记本拿出来…好了，你被「雷种子」附着之后，有什么感觉吗？还有…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭尔瓦涅"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680212,
					"content": "芭尔瓦涅，你先稍等一下，这位旅行者刚帮了我们的忙，你这个研究先缓缓吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "旭东"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680213,
					"content": "旅行者，多谢你帮忙，之前说好的报酬不会少你的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "旭东"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680214,
					"content": "但在那之前，请你再稍等一下吧。有了你拿来的「绯樱绣球」，我也可以开始做菜了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "旭东"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680215,
					"content": "我之前就听说，稻妻有一种很有特色的菜叫「绯樱天妇罗」，现在总算有机会试试看制作了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "旭东"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680216,
					"content": "我先准备一下，应该很快就能做好了，你等一下再来找我吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "旭东"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7216803,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7216804
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7216804",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7216804,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"旭东"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 721680301,
					"content": "这样…再这样…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "旭东"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680302,
					"content": "你做好了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680303
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721680303,
					"content": "还差最后一点…我得先把这个给裹上面衣，然后放进去炸…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "旭东"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680304,
					"content": "完成了！「绯樱天妇罗」，赶紧尝尝看吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "旭东"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680305,
					"content": "好、好吃，就是有点…有点烫…呼呼呼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朱莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680306,
					"content": "旭东，书上说这种叫做「天妇罗」的东西，应该还要搭配蘸汁来着…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭尔瓦涅"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680307,
					"content": "蘸汁？这我倒是真没准备，下次有机会我再研究看看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "旭东"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680308,
					"content": "这份「绯樱天妇罗」是给你的，收下吧旅行者，谢谢你帮我们这个忙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "旭东"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680309,
					"content": "还有这个「绯樱天妇罗」的制作方法，我也给你抄了一份，你就拿上吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "旭东"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680310,
					"content": "以后有机会，你也自己试试制作一下吧，做菜这件事，还是挺有趣的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680311,
						721680313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "旭东"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680311,
					"content": "谢谢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680312
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721680312,
					"content": "别客气，别客气。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "旭东"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680314,
					"content": "我们还会待在稻妻一段时间，过段时间，说不定会去<color=#00E1FFFF>神无冢</color>附近转转。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "旭东"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680316,
					"content": "而且朱莉说，她还想要去看看那棵在「鸣神大社」里的神樱树。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "旭东"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680317,
					"content": "据说，这岛上所有的「绯樱绣球」，都是从那棵大树上飘落的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "旭东"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680318,
					"content": "到底是多大的树，才能飘出那么多花瓣呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "旭东"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680319,
					"content": "如果你有兴趣的话，也过去那边看看吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "旭东"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680320,
					"content": "再次谢谢你帮忙，旅行者。我也得去吃点东西了，饿坏我了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "旭东"
				},
				{
					"id": 721680313,
					"content": "你们接下来要去哪？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721680314
					]
				}
			]
		},
